      "record": "compiler-bridge.json"
    },
    "retained_diagnostics": "The first exploratory SYSEXIT comparison had not bound the eight permitted high-half witnesses and failed. Binding those native witnesses passed. The first external llc-to-host bridge link used a static object against the host PIE default; selecting PIC in llc repaired that harness mismatch. Both original failures are retained."
  },
